    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game places players in the midst of an intense space battle, with finely detailed graphics showcasing the vastness and depth of the cosmos. Players pilot their own spacecraft, using the A and D keys to control the ship\u2019s movement left and right, skillfully responding to threats from all directions. By clicking the left mouse button, players can fire missiles to accurately strike the various geometric-shaped enemy ships. The shooting sound effects are realistic and impactful, providing a strong feedback with every launch, enhancing the immersive combat experience. Not only must players attack the enemy, they must also constantly be aware of dodging the opponents' attacks to ensure their spacecraft\u2019s safety. This is a contest of intelligence and reaction speed; who will stand out in this cosmic showdown and emerge as the ultimate victor?</p>",
